- mlx-c (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-c) -- MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 ml-explore.
- metal-cpp (Apple's header-only Metal C++ interface, vendored inside MLX and compiled into
  libmlx.dylib) -- Apache License 2.0, Copyright Apple Inc.

See LICENSE in this module for the MIT text. The Apache License 2.0 full text is at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 .

Provenance: see scripts/bootstrap-native.sh for the exact pinned mlx-metal wheel version and mlx-c
commit these binaries are built from, and native-pin.properties (packaged alongside the binaries in
this jar, at se/alipsa/jmlx/native/macos-aarch64/native-pin.properties) for the pin baked into this
specific build.
